---
title: Task implementation
---
flowchart TD
    classDef human fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#8a6d3b,color:#000
    classDef role fill:#d9edf7,stroke:#31708f,color:#000
    classDef channel fill:#dff0d8,stroke:#3c763d,color:#000
    classDef gate fill:#f2dede,stroke:#a94442,color:#000
    classDef stop fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#777,color:#000

    START(["'do next task'"]):::human
    CODER["Coder reads .claude/task.md"]:::role
    FOR{"Does the For: line say Coder?"}
    MODEL{"Does this session meet Model tier:?"}
    WEAK["Change nothing and report the required<br/>tier. Never delegate unless asked"]:::stop
    NOTMINE["For: Architect — the task is not the<br/>Coder's. Change nothing, move no marker,<br/>say so and stop"]:::stop
    PICK["Take the first subtask marked 🆕 New.<br/>Set it 🚧 In Progress before writing code.<br/>No Order Plan means the file is one task"]

    SANE{"Is the subtask right, possible,<br/>and consistent with the codebase?"}
    BAD["Append the contradiction to<br/>.claude/problems.md and stop.<br/>Do not improvise a different task"]:::stop
    BIG{"Does it need a large investigation —<br/>testing a hypothesis, reading half the tree?"}
    ASK["Stop and say so.<br/>That is Architect work"]:::stop

    IMPL["Implement, inside this subtask's scope only:<br/>source, tests in tests/,<br/>a sibling .MD for every .rs including tests,<br/>no comments in .rs,<br/>no allow or expect attributes in source"]
    SIDE{"Noticed something real<br/>but out of scope?"}
    PROB[".claude/problems.md<br/>numbered title + full description,<br/>with Importance: and Effort: estimated<br/>by the Coder, and no Thinking:, Owner:<br/>or Decision: line"]:::channel

    GATE["Run the full gate:<br/>cargo build --workspace<br/>cargo fmt --all -- --check<br/>cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings<br/>bash scripts/check_docs.sh<br/>cargo test --workspace --no-fail-fast"]:::gate
    TOUCHED{"Did the change touch storage, WAL,<br/>recovery or the double-write buffer?"}
    CRASH["Also run both crash-injection harnesses;<br/>sweep results must be unchanged"]:::gate
    PASS{"All green?"}
    FIX["Fix it — still inside this subtask"]

    MARK["Set the subtask 👀 Review in .claude/task.md:<br/>its Order Plan line and its Status: line.<br/>Never ✅ Done — only the human<br/>sets that. The emoji only: not the SP beside<br/>it, not the prose, which is the Task writer's.<br/>A P-n in the heading is provenance:<br/>that entry left problems.md when it was<br/>scheduled, so there is nothing to close"]

    STOPHERE["Stop. Do not start the next subtask,<br/>do not commit, leave the tree for review"]:::stop
    CR(["Human reviews the working tree,<br/>sets ✅ Done and commits"]):::human

    START --> CODER --> FOR
    FOR -- no --> NOTMINE
    FOR -- yes --> MODEL
    MODEL -- no --> WEAK
    MODEL -- yes --> PICK --> SANE
    SANE -- no --> BAD
    SANE -- yes --> BIG
    BIG -- yes --> ASK
    BIG -- no --> IMPL
    IMPL --> SIDE
    SIDE -- yes --> PROB --> GATE
    SIDE -- no --> GATE
    GATE --> TOUCHED
    TOUCHED -- yes --> CRASH --> PASS
    TOUCHED -- no --> PASS
    PASS -- no --> FIX --> GATE
    PASS -- yes --> MARK --> STOPHERE --> CR
